@startuml STRIDE_Threats

title STRIDE Threat Attack Vectors
caption Threat Actors and Attack Scenarios

scale max 2400 width

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

' === THREAT ACTORS ===
actor "Phishing\nActor" as phish #FFA500
actor "External\nAttacker" as threat #FF0000
actor "Malicious\nInsider" as insider #FF6B6B

' === TARGET COMPONENTS (SIMPLIFIED) ===
component "User/Clinician" as user
component "Cognito Auth" as cognito
component "API Gateway" as api
component "DynamoDB (PHI)" as db
component "S3 Files" as s3
component "KMS Keys" as kms
component "CloudTrail Logs" as trail
component "IAM Roles" as iam
component "Lambda Functions" as lambda
component "Clearinghouse" as clearinghouse

' === STRIDE THREAT ATTACKS ===
' Spoofing Attacks
phish .[#red,thickness=3].> user : **[S-01] Credential Phishing**\nEmail/SMS attacks
threat .[#red,thickness=3].> cognito : **[S-02] Token Forgery**\nSteal/forge JWT tokens
threat .[#red,thickness=3].> api : **[S-03] API Spoofing**\nForged requests

' Tampering Attacks
insider .[#orange,thickness=3].> db : **[T-01] Data Tampering**\nUnauthorized PHI changes
insider .[#orange,thickness=3].> s3 : **[T-02] File Modification**\nAlter clinical files
threat .[#orange,thickness=3].> clearinghouse : **[T-03] EDI Tampering**\nModify claims data

' Repudiation Attacks
insider .[#orange,thickness=3].> trail : **[R-01] Log Tampering**\nDelete/modify audit logs

' Information Disclosure Attacks
threat .[#red,thickness=3].> db : **[I-01] PHI Data Breach**\nSteal patient data
threat .[#orange,thickness=3].> kms : **[I-02] Key Exposure**\nSteal encryption keys
threat .[#orange,thickness=3].> api : **[I-03] Data Leakage**\nExcessive API response

' Denial of Service Attacks
threat .[#red,thickness=3].> api : **[D-01] DDoS Attack**\nFlood API endpoints
threat .[#orange,thickness=3].> lambda : **[D-02] Resource Exhaustion**\nExhaust Lambda quota

' Elevation of Privilege Attacks
insider .[#orange,thickness=3].> iam : **[E-01] Privilege Escalation**\nGain admin access
threat .[#orange,thickness=3].> lambda : **[E-02] Code Injection**\nInject malicious code

note right of phish
  **Phishing Actor**
  - Targets: Clinicians
  - Method: Email/SMS phishing
  - Goal: Steal credentials
  - Impact: Account takeover
end note

note right of threat
  **External Attacker**
  - Targets: Public endpoints
  - Methods: DDoS, SQL injection,
    token theft, API attacks
  - Goal: Data breach, disruption
  - Impact: PHI exposure, downtime
end note

note right of insider
  **Malicious Insider**
  - Targets: Internal systems
  - Methods: Privilege abuse,
    data tampering, log deletion
  - Goal: Cover tracks, steal data
  - Impact: Compliance violation
end note

legend right
  **STRIDE Categories**
  S = Spoofing Identity
  T = Tampering with Data
  R = Repudiation
  I = Information Disclosure
  D = Denial of Service
  E = Elevation of Privilege
  
  **Severity Levels**
  Red (thick) = Critical Risk
  Orange (thick) = High Risk
  
  **Total Threats: 15**
  Critical: 6
  High: 9
endlegend

@enduml
